{"id":"d2ee1021448dc9af","group":"89","path":"89/89-ax-k-axiom.md","title":"K Axiom (Distribution)","display":"ax-k-axiom — K Axiom (Distribution)","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ax-k-axiom","aliases":["89-ax-k-axiom"],"display":"ax-k-axiom — K Axiom (Distribution)","depends_on":["[[89-df-k-axiom]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ax-k-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ax-k-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-k-axiom — K Axiom (Distribution)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97dd3729fefd2e30\" href=\"?note=97dd3729fefd2e30\" title=\"89-df-k-axiom\">89-df-k-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the K-axiom schema (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97dd3729fefd2e30\" href=\"?note=97dd3729fefd2e30\" title=\"89-df-k-axiom\">89-df-k-axiom</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}k\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\Box(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\Box\\varphi\\to\\Box\\psi)\n\\in\\mathcal{A}_{K}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}k\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\Box(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\Box\\varphi\\to\\Box\\psi)\n\\in\\mathcal{A}_{K}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 模态算子 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a>)</li>\n<li>K公理：模态逻辑的最基本公理</li>\n<li>正态模态逻辑的核心公理 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a>)</li>\n<li>蕴涵的分配律</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-k-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"97dd3729fefd2e30","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-k-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-k-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"97dd3729fefd2e30","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the K-axiom schema (see [[89-df-k-axiom]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bo